# .bkitignore — suppress `bkit check` drift findings for specific Tier-3 files
# or JSON keys. See README.md § .bkitignore for syntax + examples.
#
# Scope: filters Tier-3 advisory drift only. Does NOT skip Tier-2 core template
# writes or payload copies — those always reflect `.bkit/templates/`.
#
# Example patterns (uncomment to use):
#
#   .github/workflows/ci.yml                  # consumer has custom CI jobs
#   .vale/**                                  # custom prose style overrides
#   .claude/settings.json:hooks.Stop          # per-key (BKIT_BKITIGNORE_PER_KEY=1)
